A||N||5||mbramble||Aero Front Fascia Question||||1||
Z||000000||mbramble||10-22-2000||11:34 AM||||I recently put an aero fascia on the front of my coupe.  Didn't pay particular attention to how things looked underneath but I did get everything that came off the donor car.<P>If I look up underneath the front of the fascia, all I see is radiator.  Doesn't seem quite right that it is exposed so much to road debris.  My old coupe fasica has a plastic panel that blocked the radiator.  Evidently that piece had been removed from the donor.<P>I could put something there but don't want to block the radiator from cooling air.  Can someone tell me what is mounted under the fascia, and what areas it covers up.  There is an 'air dam' that runs from one side of the fasca to the other that is directly under the radiator.  Looks like it's purpose is to direct air up to the radiator.  But, if that entire open area is covered to protect the radiator, this 'dam' would be no good for that purpose.<P>Help, I'm getting ready to go on a long trip and would like to put some protection under there without blocking off proper air circulation.<P>Thanks,<BR>Mike<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||10-22-2000||11:55 AM||||Nothing is missing....that's how all GT fascias look.   ||||reg||1
Z||000002||mbramble||10-22-2000||12:15 PM||||So, all I should see basically, when looking under the fascia, is radiator???<P>Thanks,<BR>Mike<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||tgowens||10-22-2000||12:56 PM||||yep Mike, that's basically all you see is a radiator!! Sounds like you did it right -- I have two '87 GTs and there are about twenty more sitting around me here at the Fiero Shop and they are all the same under the aero fascia -- just radiator............<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/tgowens_sig.gif">                          <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A> - Blue '87 GT - Gold '87 GT<BR><A HREF="http://www.cfog.org" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog.org</A> - Classic Fiero Owners Group||||reg||1
Z||000004||mbramble||10-22-2000||01:20 PM||||OK, thanks much guys.  It was just so different than what was under the front of my coupe fascia.  Just wanted to make sure....<P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||stsmithgt||10-23-2000||04:41 PM||||I wouldnt tailgate anybody down a gravel road.  If you think about it...hmmmmmmm m m m m m m m m m?.?.?..what would really get in there unless you drive over branches, bushes...small dogs..... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">J/k (at least I didn't say small children)<BR>||||reg||12
